  "source": "eternalsp sheet + community feedback v4 (combat tags, terrain formula, priority buckets, pilot role gates)",
  "notes": [
    "MS bands/ranks/weapon tiers synced to creator DB sheet (not the outdated public How it works page).",
    "MAP uses mapammo only (changelog Dec 24); flat mapweapon row is not double-counted.",
    "Support DEF tier typo 83000 → 8300.",
    "v3: series/flavor tags excluded from tag-count; high-value tags are combat/niche only.",
    "v3: N/R/SR rarity adjustment; warships excluded; pure permanent ATK/DEF/HP/MOB passives skip ability points.",
    "v4: drop unit tag-count bands; combat-tag bonus only (cap +2).",
    "v4: terrain = 0 for Space+Land deploy, +1 per extra deployable terrain, −2 if missing Land or Space.",
    "v4: bucket labels Priority / Strong / Situational / Low; higher letter cutoffs.",
    "v4: Support max-debuff softened; Attack HP/range floors tighter; Higher-range weapon bonus ignored when max range ≤ 3.",
    "v4: pilot tag-count zeroed; Hard ER combat-tag cap +1; recommended MS role-gated; tension-gated kit lines score 0.",
    "Suggestion-list philosophy: strictly-better extras matter; close letters need human judgment."
